  "remarks": "JSC “Kotlin-Novator” is one of the key enterprises in the Russian military and industrial complex. It develops, produces and provides services in the area of advanced onboard flight navigation systems for military transport airplanes and special purpose airplanes. The company is also actively developing collaborations with leading Russian aviation companies including PJSC UAC, Sukhoi Bureau, Irkut and Tupulev. It has also started developing and producing a dual-use quadcopter “Wind”. Moreover, it has developed a mid-range drone X-89, a heavy transport drone “Buran”, as well as a reconnaissance drone EVTOL apparatus Y-89.",
